From f56c7ff06811eadfe299a2a73a075c4dea0edcca Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dan on Selwyn <dan@selwyn>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 03:00:00 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 29/32] ARM: dts: broadcom: us-48-500w: Add PoE power budget
 and PSE PIs

Add the PoE budget (48 x 30 W) as fixed regulators (total, one per PoE card) and
the four pse-pi nodes of each BCM59111, with the front port range of every
chip in a comment. The PIs have no pairsets or ports: the ge ports have no
phy_device a pses phandle could be attached to.

Signed-off-by: TODO
